  "title": "United Arab Emirates: TotalEnergies Announces Final Investment Decision for the Umm Shaif Gas Cap Development",
  "summary": "Paris, July 21, 2026 – TotalEnergies announces the Final Investment Decision (FID) for the Umm Shaif Gas Cap development in the Umm Shaif and Nasr offshore concession, in which the Company holds a 20% interest alongside ADNOC (60%), CNPC (10%) and ENI (10%), with ADNOC Offshore as operator. Umm Shaif is Abu Dhabi’s oldest offshore […]",
